  <Strings>
    <Section>Story</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>9536</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ぐふふ〜……
&lt;Kunzite&gt;ってば、実は
アンを気に入ってるでしょぉ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hehehe. &lt;Kunzite&gt;, you sure seem to be fond of that An girl.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>9820</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>リチアも『そっち系』だし
クンチャイトってひょっとして
……ロリ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Lithia's kinda like “that” too. Could it be that you're... into the younger crowd?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>10116</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>『ロ……リ』……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>“Younger...crowd”...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>10208</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>自分は、ロ……リ……？
・肯定
・否定</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Am I “into the younger crowd?”
・Affirmative.
・Negative.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>10348</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>肯定。
自分は偽物のスピリアしか
持たない機械人だ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Affirmative. If you are implying I seek out younger companions to maximize the overlap of our lifespans.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>10728</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ゆえに、常に『孤独』……
つまり『ロンリー』なのだ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>As a mechanoid with a synthetic Spiria, solitude, or perhaps “loneliness,” is indeed a prevalent concern...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>11000</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ちょっとからかっただけなのに
そんなさみしい話に
発展させなくても……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Uh, wow... I was just teasing, I didn't expect things to get deep...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>11284</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Kunzite&gt;は
ロンリーじゃないよ！
ボクたちがそばにいるじゃないか</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But there's no need to feel lonely, you've got all of us!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>11656</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……&lt;Beryl&gt;の慰め確認。
感謝する</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Words of comfort acknowledged. You have my gratitude.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>11984</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……だが、オマエに
必要以上の好意を持った場合
『ロリ』と呼ばれる可能性大だ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...However, if you continue to show me an excessive amount of affection, by your logic, are very likely to be considered among the “younger crowd”.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>12344</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なんだとぉ〜〜〜!?
ボクは『ロリ』呼ばわりされる
年齢じゃないぞぉっ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What was that?! I'll have you know, I am an ADULT!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>12872</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>否定。『ロリ』が
『年下好み』という意味であれば
リチア様は、その属性の対象外だ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Negative. “Younger crowd” would refer to those of a younger age, so Master Lithia would not meet that qualification.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>13168</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>むしろ現在の世界で
自分より年上なのは
リチア様とクリードのみだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Rather, at present, Master Lithia and Creed are the only beings with seniority over me.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>13240</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そっか……！
リチアって二千歳なんだっけ!?</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh yeah, Lithia's 2000 years old, isn't she?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>13664</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>肯定。おそらく&lt;Beryl&gt;の
ひいひいひいひいひいひいひい
ひいひいひいひいひいひいひい</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Affirmative. She is likely from the same generation as your great great great great great great great great great great great great great great</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>14024</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ひいひいひいひいひいひいひい
ひいひいひいひいひいひいひい
ひいひいひいひいひいひいひい</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>great great great great great great great great great great great great great great</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>14264</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ひいひいひいひいひいひいひい
ひいひいひいひいひいひいひい
ひいひいひいひいひいひいひい</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>great great great great great great great great great great great great great great</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>14672</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ひいひいひいひいひいひいひい
ひいグランマと同世代だろう</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>great great great great great great great great great great great great great great great grandmother.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>15240</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……&lt;Kunzite&gt;
うしろ、うしろ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Kunzite&gt;, look out! Behind you!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>15828</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Kunzite&gt;……今の情報は
超Ｓ級特別最高封印機密情報として
公開を厳禁とします！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Kunzite&gt;? That information is strictly prohibited from disclosure, with its secrecy paramount to none!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>16288</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>りょ、了解しました</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>U-Understood.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
